 "text": "St. Clair County\nThis content is outside the St. Clair County website\n×\nContinue\nCancel\nFAQ's\nState of Michigan\nGeneral Property Tax Act\nProperty Tax & Maps Search\n443\nSt. Clair County\nSearch Results\n×\nSearch St. Clair County Website\nThis Page is Password Protected\n×\nAccess to the contents of this page is restricted. To view the contents\nof the page, type the correct password and then click 'Confirm'.\nPassword\nConfirm\nClose\nContact Form\n×\nThank you for contacting us. Your message has been sent to .\nWe will do our best to respond to your message in a timely manner.\nSend Email To: :\nYour Email Address\nYour Message\nCancel Send Email\nSt. Clair County\nDepartments\nEqualization\nProperty Tax & Maps Search\nProperty Tax & Maps Search\nProperty Tax & Maps Search\nProperty Tax Estimator\nParcel Details\nDelinquent Tax\n-->\n-->\nWhat should I enter for the search criteria?\nOwner Name\nIf you enter the letters DAV, the search will return all parcels whose owner's last names begin with DAV (example - DAVIS). Enter the owner's last name followed by a space before entering their first name. First names are always optional and are commonly abbreviated so you may have better results by entering the last name only.\nStreet Number\nEnter the address number of the physical address located on the property you are searching for (example: 5480).\nStreet Name\nEnter the name of the street only. - Often, the type of road (road, street, trail, court) and directional (north, south, east, west) are abbreviated and can be omitted from your search.\nParcel Number\nEntering a parcel number such as 74-20-006 will return all of the parcels beginning with 74-20-006. Enter the dashes (-) in the parcel number to match the format 74-XX-XXXX-XXX (no spaces between dashes are needed).\nPlease note that multiple fields cannot be searched at the same time. So, only the active box (when you hit ENTER) or the item that you clicked to “Search” is queried.\nSearch Parcels\nParcel Instructions\nOur database is only able to search by one set of criteria at a time.\nPlease input information in only one of the following boxes.\nPlease enter values on the following fields\n|\nOwner Name |\n|\n|\nStreet Number |\n|\n|\nStreet Name |\n|\n|\nParcel Number |\n|\n|\n|\nSearch Parcels |\nContact Information\nCounty Equalization Department - Assessing and Valuation Information\nCounty Treasurer Office - Property Tax Information\nLocations\n×\nSt. Clair County Administration Building\nContacts\n×\nEqualization\n810-989-6925\nFront Desk\nHOURS\nMonday-Friday\n8:00AM\n4:30PM\nEmails\n×\nEqualization\nEqualizationDept@stclaircounty.org\nContacts at SCC\nDepartments\n×\nAppointments to Boards and Commissions\nAdministrator / Controller\nAirport\nAnimal Control\nBlue Water Convention Center\nBoard of Commissioners\nBuilding Operations and Maintenance\nCentral Dispatch\nCommunity Mental Health\nCommission on Aging\nCounty Clerk\nCourts\nDay Treatment / Night Watch\nDrain Commissioner\nEmergency Management\nEqualization\nFriend of Court\nGIS\nHuman Resources\nLandfill and Recycling\nInformation Technology\nLibrary\nMedical Examiner\nMetro Planning Commission\nMSU Extension\nParks and Recreation\nPlat Board\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Defender\nPublic Guardian\nPublic Health\nPurchasing\nRegister of Deeds\nRetirement System\nRoad Commission\nSheriffs Office\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nVeterans Affairs",
